{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54361","headline":"过夷门献诗 · 杜荀鹤","name":"过夷门献诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四海九州空第一，不同诸镇府封王。\n（《旧五代史》卷二四、《登科记考》卷二四引《唐新纂》。\n此则承汤华泉同志见告）（〖1〗《唐新纂》：「荀鹤举进士及第，东归过夷门，献梁太祖诗句云〖诗略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}